window.products.push({"id":1063130,"name":"Nouhaus Palette Ergonomic Office Chair Comfortable Swivel Computer Desk Chair, Lumbar Adjust Rolling Chair. (Bright Orange)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":179.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51fEHGSzcFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"COLOR YOUR LIFE IN COMFORT: With ‘Just-For-Me’ Lumbar Adjust, 2:1 Synchro Tilt, Height Variable Armrests, a compact size and rich vibrant colors, The Palette by NOUHAUS can only be described as a swivel chair with Spatial Mindfulness. It’s comfort with looks, so you can sit how you want, but better. ‘JUST-FOR-ME’ LUMBAR SUPPORT OFFICE CHAIR: It’s rare to sit the same at the start of the day as we do at the end, or when we’re relaxed vs tired, stressed or sore. So the Palette supports you all day long with an adjustable lower back support, and combines it with 135 Degree 2:1 Synchro Tilt that tilts the back of your chair AND your seat together. Now you’re sitting with 100% ‘Just-For-Me’ Comfort. STRONG, HEIGHT VARIABLE ARMS: Lean into it, because this ergonomic chair lets you adjust these armrests to your perfect height. Engineered for both vertical and horizontal load and covered with Soft-Grip PU, you can lean exactly how you want, knowing that your arms are supported and comfortable. HEAVY DUTY DESK CHAIR: The Palette has a HD Nylon Base fitted with structural ribs and gussets, and takes 240lbs max. Weight is no problem for the smooth Class-4 Gas Lift offering a solid seat to floor height of 17.5” to 21.25”. You have a max 20.25” hip room between each armrest, supportive open cell foam cushion with soft ElastoMesh Cover, making it very comfortable to sit in for long hours. EASY TO ASSEMBLE: The Palette is easy to put together and comes with tools and instructions. When yours arrives, you’ll notice it’s light (27.5lbs). So, why not take a look at your space now, and choose YOUR color Palette.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51fEHGSzcFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nouhaus","source_asin":"B083SNF2XY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1063130","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083SNF2XY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B083SNF2XY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
