window.products.push({"id":1063192,"name":"Medoore 2 Pack St. Patrick's Day Gnome Decorations, Irish Leprechaun Swedish Gnome Ornaments Green Irish Leprechaun Tomte Gnomes Doll Elf for Home Dec","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718yJHAxtnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Features: Gnome is excellent for spreading the traditional spirit. In folklore, gnome guards home and protect people from misfortune. It brings good luck to the family and is regarded as good luck. And the St. Patrick's Day Gnome are lightly filled with hypoallergenic polyester stuffing and entirely hand sewn. There is a wire in his tall hat to make it in a different pose. The weighted bottom lets it stand alone stable. Specifications: Material: wood felt Color: as picture shown Length: 10.2 inches Width: 3.5 inches Package includes: 2 X St. Patrick's Day Gnome Decorations","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718yJHAxtnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Medoore","source_asin":"B08SC5Q254","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1063192","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08SC5Q254","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08SC5Q254","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1063193,"name":"Santa with an Angel on Blue Glass Christmas Tree Topper 11 Inches","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51QnZ3c0EbL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"11 Inches Tall (28 cm) German Glass Italian Paint Mouth Blown Hand Painted Glittered Accents Made in Ukraine Apart from the Christmas balls, figurines, lights and bows, who wouldn't vie to place the most important piece of décor in every tree is the tree topper. It’s considered to be the crowning glory and adds a finishing touch that’s why it earned a special spot in the Christmas tree. Since in the 19th century, adding a tree topper became a tradition. It also goes to a debate about whether an angel or a star should be placed. Over the years, trendier designs arise which suits the taste and design of the generation. BestPysanky is home to hand-painted ornaments with intricate patterns and delicately detailed scenes. Decorate your tree or add tabletop centerpiece with our meticulously crafted topper using traditional techniques that originated in the 1800's. The Renaissance-era molding, glass blowing, silver lining, painting and finishing processes require unparalleled skill and several weeks to complete. The molten glass is mouth-blown into finely carved molds to shape the topper. It is then painted and glittered in a series of labor-intensive steps to achieve the beautiful final products. Exquisite workmanship and details are the hallmark of all BestPysanky ornaments. We aim to bring warmth, color, spirit and sparkle into your home with our unique decor, as you admire and celebrate the holidays with your loved ones. It's more than just a decoration- it's a work of art!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51QnZ3c0EbL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BestPysanky","source_asin":"B00NMSTIFK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1063193","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00NMSTIFK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00NMSTIFK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1063194,"name":"ELSOON W10616906 Pouring Shield Compatible with KitchenAid 4.5-5 Quart Stand Mixer KN1PS K45SS K4 K5 - Replace 3177975 3177976 3177977 4162314 4162315","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61rSw6P9MBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Part Name: Pouring Shield Brand: ELSOON Specification: Weight:232g Features: 1.This pouring shield is made of a durable plastic construction for reliable use, and it is easy to install without need of tools. 2.This pouring shield is dishwasher safe and easy to clean. 3.Perfect match and good choice for direct replacement of parts. Applications: Replace Part Numbers:3177975, 3177976, 3177977, 4162314, 4162315, 4163467, 4163468, 4169995, 4176071, 4176115, 4176452, 4176453, 9701671, 9704568, 9706633, 9708130, 9709923, W11298367, WPW10616906, PS12723742, W11312468. This pouring shield fits for K45SS, KSM75, KSM95, KSM150PS, KSM152PS, K4, K5, KP50, KSM5, KSM50, KSM500PS, KSM450 and more. Installation Tips: 1.Put pouring shield on the top of the mixing bowl. 2.Adjust pouring shield’s angle to fit the mixing bowl. 3.Adding wet or dry ingredients into mixing bowl with this pouring shield. Package Includes: 1 x Pouring Shield Warranty:1 year Warranty Note: Please check the pictures for more details to avoid unnecessary return. 1.Dishwasher is safe, but hand washing can extend service life. 2.There is no pouring shield available for stainless hammered or quilted textured bowls, glass bowls, ceramic bowls. DO NOT use for glass bowls and ceramic bowls. 3.NOT ALL applicable models are listed. For your better shopping experience, you can contact us if you are not sure the model numbers. 4.The size of this pouring shield was measured by us, which is precise and correct. If you are not sure the model number, you can compare the size of the old one to choose. Contact us if you have any questions about it, we will get back to you as soon as possible.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61rSw6P9MBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ELSOON","source_asin":"B08YQMVR5N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1063194","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08YQMVR5N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08YQMVR5N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
