window.products.push({"id":1063279,"name":"Superior Chin-Zhou Aloeswood - 8\" Stick Incense - 100% Natural - F058T","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AB868gc4L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This incense is primarily made of pure heavy-resin Sorong Chin-Zhou Aloeswood (Agarwood). The thick and pleasant aroma of agarwood while burning and residual scent are two significant features, and that made it become our most famous and popular incense product. The smell will easily penetrate to next room or floor even though you just burn a single stick of this incense. It will get better and better day by day if stored appropriately. We guarantee there is no extraction of agarwood essential oil before making this stick incense. The fragrance can help alleviate the physical and psychological pressure, stabilize the nerve and depression, improve the sleeping quality, ..., and so on. Raw materials are 100% natural.***Key Ingredients:+Superior [3rd] grade heavy-resin Indonesian Chin-Zhou aloeswood (90%, contains 3% jinko agarwood)+Machilus zuihensis Hayata powder (10%)**Please note:--For those who got used to perfumed incense with strong scent, you may not be able to feel this fully natural fragrance. We suggest to fresh your nose for a few days (in order to recover olfactory senses) before burning this incense. *This incense will smell better in cool seasons.--In the international market of raw materials, raw agarwood (Aloeswood) has become very expensive now because of its scarce. The value of agarwood (aloeswood) incense is based on its purity and smell. Agarwood incense contains stronger and sweet aroma with higher purity will be more popular and priced higher. --For supporting environmental protection, some of our incense boxes are recycled used in order to reduce waste.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AB868gc4L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bosen Incense","source_asin":"B0014DL326","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1063279","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0014DL326","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0014DL326","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
