window.products.push({"id":1063284,"name":"XINJUN Memory Foam car Lumbar Support Pillow - Memory Foam Back Cushion - Used for car Seats, Office Chairs, recliners, Sofas, etc. (Gray)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":30.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/516-lPxGeOS._AC_.jpg","description":"Are you suffering from lumbar/back pain？ Are you suffering lumbar/ back pain from driving or sitting in the office for a long hour ?You are not alone. In a large survey, about 82.7% of adults experienced lumbar pain or back pain in their lifetimes. More than 33.7% of adults experienced that pain during the last half year. What you need is a memory foam car seat back cupports which keep supportive and comfortable throughout the year. If you spend a lot of time driving or sitting, this lumbar support for car 3D ergonomic design One main lower breathable mesh part. Extra thick and wide. our ergonomic pillow is made to fit the spine’s natural curve and the body’s natural form. Two higher parts on two sides gently hold front your waist. The impression-making effect of memory foam will also take pressure off your spine, gently guiding your body into a healthy position that circulates blood and relieves tension. Application Fields This seat pillow is suitable for office chair, car seat, wheelchair,recliner, gaming chair, any home chair or seat on a bus, airplane or train. And backrest pads is suitable for drivers, teachers, students, people need wheelchair, pregnant women, office workers etc. Reliable and friendly customer service Warm Tips: 1.If you use this lumbar pillow for car,it is better to move your seat back 1.3-2 inches than you usually drive.If not, you would drive closer to the steering wheel and pedals with less leg room to rest your knees on long drive.Highly recommend it to Medium car, do not recommend to Compact car. 2.NOTE: Even our back cushion lumbar support is designed to help relieve back pain but with some people it will not completely eliminate all symptoms. 3.Cushion cover is washable,but do not wash foam core. 4.It is recommended to use vacuum cleaner to clean up the dust of the cushion cover regularly. 5.Do not expose the back cushion to the sun, or it will reduce its service life. 6.Note: There are mainly two kinds of memory foam in the mark","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/516-lPxGeOS._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"XINJUN","source_asin":"B097NGTQLX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1063284","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097NGTQLX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B097NGTQLX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
