window.products.push({"id":1063510,"name":"Stainless Steel Rabbit Wine Opener Set With 2 Metallic Ice Cubes, Wine Aerator Pourer, Wine Stopper & Foil Cutter By Setoris- Manual Wine Bottle Opene","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":38.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TITfz0oHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"RABBIT CORKSCREW WINE OPENER FOR SMOOTH CORK REMOVAL: Our heavy-duty rabbit wine bottle opener features a strong and durable construction with a sturdy spiral that can effortlessly remove any synthetic or natural cork with just a quick pull of the lever. And the best part? The non-stick worm guarantees that the cork will not disintegrate and fall back into your bottle! COMPLETE WINE OPENER ACCESSORY SET: To ensure a great wine drinking experience, our screwpull wine accessory set includes: Manual Winged Wine Opener, Spare Corkscrew Spirals, Wine Aerator Pourer, Vacuum Stopper/Wine Stopper and Foil Cutter. It also comes with two reusable, Metalic Ice Cubes that will chill your drinks without watering them down. A cool way to enjoy your favorite glass of wine at just the right temperature! ERGONOMIC LEVER FOR EFFORTLESS CORK REMOVAL: Thanks to its innovative, rabbit design, this lever wine opener gets the job done in 2 quick and pain-free moves: Pull down on the lever once the warm is placed on top of the cork and just pull it up again to remove the cork right on the spot. No more tiring, manual twisting and pulling. A foolproof choice for sommeliers, bartenders, waiters and any other wine professionals! AVAILABLE IN STAINLESS STEEL & BRONZE QUALITY FOR SUPREME DURABILITY: Our premium manual wine openers come in 2 designs: Stainless Steel Wine Opener & Bronze Wine Opener. No matter which one you choose, you may rest assured that your new handheld rabbit wine bottle openers are rust and corrosion resistant to remain in excellent condition for a lifetime. A TIMELESS GIFT IDEA FOR ANY TRUE WINE LOVER: Surprise your friends, family or colleagues with this classy, great-quality wine bottle corkscrew opener that makes a foolproof -equally beautiful and practical- gift for any festive occasion. Great for Father’s Day, Housewarming Parties, Weddings, Birthdays, Christmas and so much more!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TITfz0oHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Setoris","source_asin":"B0BVRWWTBN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1063510","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BVRWWTBN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BVRWWTBN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
