window.products.push({"id":1063775,"name":"Portable Air Conditioners - Personal Fan Mini AC with Timing, 3 Speeds Quiet, Air Humidifier Misting Fan for Home, Office, Room","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81WvLQthpbS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【4 in 1 Portable Air Conditioner】The latest 4 in 1 personal air conditioner in 2021 can be used as a fan, humidifier, mini air conditioner and night light. Adding ice/water in the air cooler will bring you moist air and prevent your skin from drying out. 【3 Wind Speed and Low Noise】The personal air conditioner has 3 high, medium and low wind speeds, which can be switched as needed. Our air cooler has low noise and will not interfere with your sleep and work. 【2 / 4H Timed Energy-saving Air Conditioner】The personal portable air conditioner fan has a timer function (2 / 4H), which allows you to sleep comfortably without worrying about the cold and the power consumption of the air cooler. 【7-color LED Light and Large-capacity Water Tank】The air cooler has a 420ml water tank, which can work for 4-6 hours after being loaded with ice/water. The water tank is detachable and easy to clean. The portable air conditioner has built-in LED lights of 7 colors, which can create a good atmosphere for you and help you fall asleep. (You can turn it off when not in use.) 【Provide 1 Year Warranty】Mini air conditioner, light and portable, easy to move, suitable for office, bedroom and kitchen. The air conditioner has a 1 year warranty. If you have any problems with your air cooler, please contact us at any time and we will solve it for you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81WvLQthpbS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SHAALEK","source_asin":"B08VJ2K39Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1063775","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08VJ2K39Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08VJ2K39Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1063776,"name":"Add An Accent - CHRISTMAS TREE FAIRY - Cicely Mary Barker - Flower Fairy - AAA-86922","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61xjFj4nY5L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Christmas Tree Fairy Ornament - Height 4\"- this 'free-flying' Fairy ornament comes in a beautifully illustrated pictorial window gift box. Each comes with a fine gold cord for hanging as well as a detachable 6\" metal floral pick for use in a plant or basket. Series IV The Christmas Tree Fairy The little Christmas Tree was born And dwelt in open air; It did not guess how bright a dress Some day its boughs would wear; Brown cones were all, it thought, a tall And grown-up Fir would bear. O little Fir! Your forest home Is far and far away; And here indoors these boughs of yours With coloured balls are gay, With candle-light, and tinsel bright, For this is Christmas Day! A dolly-fairy stands on top, Till children sleep; then she (A live one now!) from bough to bough Goes gliding silently. O magic sight, this joyous night! O laden, sparkling tree!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61xjFj4nY5L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Add an Accent","source_asin":"B01N7M0WID","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1063776","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N7M0WID","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N7M0WID","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1063777,"name":"Veggie Dye Block Print Tapestry Cotton Bedspread 108\" x 88\" Full-Queen Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81h3ADDu9XL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"BLOCK PRINT INDIAN TAPESTRY - Hand block printed vegetable dye tapestry. Very primitive appeal with drops of misplaced dye or smudges from the artists hands as he pressed his blocks to the fabric, forever leaving his trace. It does not get any closer to \"handcraft\" than this. Please note that print and dye imperfections are not to be considered defects but rather primitive characteristics associated to the art of hand block printing, the oldest and slowest form of textile printing known to man. Measures approx. 108 x 88 inches and will work for a full or queen size bed. It is made of 100% power-loom cotton offering a smooth, durable weave. Can be machine washed separately on cool/gentle and tumble dried. Lovely floral vine pattern with little partridges along the border in shades of blue, black and gray on grayish beige background. Truly a work of art which can only be achieved by human hand, make this tapestry a treasure to own. A lovely quality with endless versatility. Your hand block printed tapestry can be used for: ~FURNITURE COVER~BEDSPREADTABLECLOTH~BEACH BLANKET~ ~ROOM DIVIDER~A GREAT AFFORDABLE GIFTHANG THEM ON YOUR WALL OR CEILING~! We hope to inspire your imagination & creativity~:-)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81h3ADDu9XL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Homestead","source_asin":"B00BL7WIYM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1063777","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00BL7WIYM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00BL7WIYM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
