window.products.push({"id":1063924,"name":"Soul & Lane Madrona Striped Grey and White Throw Blanket - 50\" x 60\": 100% Cotton Modern Coverlet, Quilted Patchwork Bedspread, Modern Dark Olive Thro","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":45.4,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91LhU3F--pL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This cozy boys comforter with grey and white stripes graphics will turn any bedroom into an inviting spot to chill. The handsome traditional patchwork pattern gives this grey bedding throw an amazing look for any home. Our thin quilts are designed for use by the whole family or as thoughtful housewarming or engagement gifts for your friends. For added versatility, one side of the lightweight quilt showcases the traditional stripes pattern and subtle geometric shapes, while the other features a grey and white pinstripe pattern. Simply flip the cotton quilt over for plenty of styling options that will blend beautifully with any decor style. Our country quilts are cozy and stylish. Featuring a breathable 100% cotton with a 100% polyester fill, this men's throw blanket is designed to be soft and breathable. Its lightweight construction and ideal thickness make this camping bedding quilt a great option for year-round use. Quilted stitches in a unique looping pattern are sewn through the gray pattern comforter for durability and added coziness. Our mens bedspreads are also machine washable, which means caring for them is quick and easy! Toss the farmhouse bedding into the wash with cold water and tumble dry on a low setting. These mens style throw are designed to retain their beauty wash after wash so they will always have a warm and inviting touch. There are many ways to use this 100% cotton comforter both at home and away from it. Take this country bedding along your adventures by bringing it to your cabin, cottage, lake house, or mountain retreat lodge. You’ll be able to enjoy the relaxing sanctuary of home no matter where you are! You can even lay these soft quilts across the sofa or chair for those evenings by the fire or hang them on the wall as an unexpected piece of wall art at the cabin. No matter where you decide to use these outdoorsy quilts for women, you will have many relaxing nights and countless sweet dreams nestled under the wonderful softness of our rustic comforters.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91LhU3F--pL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Soul & Lane","source_asin":"B0BS1VD132","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1063924","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BS1VD132","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BS1VD132","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
