window.products.push({"id":1063961,"name":"Now House by Jonathan Adler Chroma Square Lacquer Tray, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+B4pPH8VL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Chroma Square Lacquer Tray, White: Our glossy lacquer trays are your house heroes. Use them to serve small bites or drinks, stack them up with books or magazines, or organize your counter and tabletop extras in any room. Now House by Jonathan Adler introduces smart new decorative accessories, furniture, rugs, bedding and more – all designed to make living an effortless (and ever-chic) pursuit. With styles ranging from mid-century to ultra-modern, you’ll never run out of ways to wow. It’s what’s new, it’s what’s now. Now House by Jonathan Adler: Smile, you’re home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+B4pPH8VL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Now House by Jonathan Adler","source_asin":"B07GC5LLP5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1063961","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GC5LLP5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GC5LLP5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1063962,"name":"Kalia 10-inch 2 Tier Genuine Bamboo Steamer Basket ideal for cooking vegetables, Asian food, dim sum, bao buns, dumplings. Extras- bamboo fork and spo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81v1v19tV1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"<b>BONUS ITEMS!!</b> – 1 bamboo fork, 1 bamboo spoon, 1 bamboo set of chopsticks and 10 paper liners come free with each Kalia Bamboo steamer. The cutlery measures 8 inches in legnth. Each piece is made sturdy and built to last. The wooden chopsticks, fork and spoon are skillfully finished for a smooth, even feel. Also, we provide you with 10 paper liners so you can get cooking immediately! <b>HEALTHY, SIMPLE COOKING</b> - Cook Asian food, such as Chinese dumplings or bao buns, quickly and easily. The Kalia Steamer is great for cooking every-day meals such as vegetables and fish as well. Vegetables like broccoli, cauliflower, Brussel sprouts and asparagus are ready in as little as 5 minutes. Prepare salmon to juicy perfection in 15 minutes. The two-tiered structure provides plenty of room, making it perfect for food prep as well. <b>ELEGANT, DURABLE DESIGN</b> – Genuine bamboo. Each steamer is individually assembled by a master craftsman using centuries old techniques refined through time. Each lid consists of thin slabs of bamboo intricately interwoven to retain heat and allow any excess steam to escape. The body of each steaming chamber is reinforced by multiple layers of bamboo. With proper care, your Kalia steamer will provide hundreds of healthy delicious meals. <b>30-SECOND CLEANUP</b> – Clean-up is a cinch with the Kalia Bamboo Steamer. Simply line the bottom of each basket with the paper provided to minimize direct contact with food. Cabbage, lettuce and parchment paper serve as great liners as well. When it’s time for clean-up, discard the liner, brush off any food debris left behind and give your steamer a thorough rinse with warm water for several seconds. Set it aside to dry in a well- ventilated area and you’re done! <b>90 DAY PRODUCT GUARANTEE</b> – If you are unhappy with your steamer, simply notify us within 90 days of the purchase date and we will replace your steamer free of charge. Each steamer is the work of human hands and constructed with what nature provides. Mistakes sometimes occur. Nevertheless, your satisfaction is our highest priority and we’ll work diligently to ensure that your expectations are met. Order now!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81v1v19tV1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kalia","source_asin":"B08DG6S6BX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1063962","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08DG6S6BX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08DG6S6BX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1063963,"name":"Winged Sirenny Pairs of 4\" (10cm) Short Silk Flutter Folding Fan for Worship and Chinese Folk Dance Performance","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81yq8cVWbZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Silk Imported These beautiful silk fans for traditional Chinese folk dance are not only dance props for stage performances. With their bright colors, they can also be used for home or party decorations. They also provide a cool breeze in summer, making them a great personalized gift. Attention They are NOT the plastic Taichi fans that make a loud noise when opened. Note: The circular edges are not hemmed because the silk is only 4 inches long and hemming would interfere with movement. You can trim the edges once in a while if you like. 2 layers of 4 inches (10 cm) silk over 12 inches (30 cm) long bamboo sticks. The fans are easy to fold and unfold, keeping your dance seamless. They do not have shiny sequins that will eventually come off the silk and just leave ugly glue spots. We use sturdy bamboo sticks that are wider and thicker than most other fans. They are carefully checked for splinters and will not hurt your hand. The lightweight silk flutters beautifully. Hand painted bright colors with soft gradations. If you find any of the following problems, contact us for a free refund: wrong hand, wrong colors, stains, silk holes, silk falling off the bamboo, cracked bamboo ribs. Never wash the fans. Keep them away from water. Steam iron to erase the wrinkles of silk to have the best floating.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81yq8cVWbZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Winged Sirenny","source_asin":"B099JMPCKF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1063963","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B099JMPCKF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B099JMPCKF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
